              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mollycurls77"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was just all right. It's the only marinade recipe I could find that I had all the ingredients for. I'm not too keen on molasses, and I found the molasses flavour to be very strong, the powdered ginger measurement could also be reduced. Molasses is also a little tricky when grilling because it burns very quickly. Not sure if I'll use this one again.",
