            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "awesome recipe,,, i've been looking for a marinade made with molasses for a while. Tried it on beef Kabobs found it outstanding. For the faint of heart you may try backing off on the pepper just a bit",
            "datePublished": "2002-08-28T16:00:29.047Z"
