            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "WOW. I used this on some arm steaks that my wife got on sale. I was a little worried about how tough the steak might be, but it turned out great, and the marinade was a BIG hit. Only problem was I put in a little TOO much hot sauce -- now I know better!!",
